# finale, section 7, in parallel: per-player queues
deliverance examine heard          # listens to the fire: the officer's sentence
deliverance relay remember         # tells her the fold (carried) and which page (heard)
deliverance examine seen           # reads the slate's marks aloud for the blind bearer
deliverance needs testimony
deliverance workh* testimony       # one voice says it whole
remember needs heard
remember show mindwell             # points Mindwell to page 8
remember workh* carried            # her hands open the paper under his direction
remember workh* said               # writes the father's words from memory
remember workh* slate              # the four lines in the form; raises the board
remember show deliverance          # shows the speaker the slate
waitstill workh* seen              # the blind bearer says what the marks mean, with his eyes
mindwell needs heard
mindwell workh* heard              # the deaf bearer decodes page 8
